# Committed AppMap gold-trace baselines are machine-written JSON, sometimes tens
# of thousands of lines on one line. Marking them binary keeps them out of diffs
# and merge attempts: a baseline is replaced wholesale when it is blessed, never
# edited by hand or merged line by line, so a textual diff of one is noise in
# every review it appears in.
gold_traces/baseline/appmaps/**/*.appmap.json binary
